00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:58.310
to be called iTunes, so that I can
accumulate all this stuff to listen to.

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:04.065
Now in so far as listening, of
course I have AirPods, which are

00:04:04.065 --> 00:04:07.875
in many ways the best, because they
seem to be better at syncing and

00:04:07.875 --> 00:04:09.885
connecting to these various devices.

00:04:10.185 --> 00:04:14.385
However, if I'm, let's say I'm a
cross-country skiing, I certainly

00:04:14.385 --> 00:04:16.695
don't want to drop an iPod in the snow.

00:04:17.385 --> 00:04:22.275
Uh, if I go down to the park and I run
and then I might do some, you know,

00:04:22.275 --> 00:04:27.675
burpees or other things where my head's
moving around, I could again drop my iPod.

00:04:27.675 --> 00:04:32.145
So whenever I'm doing something
that's more active, I've also invested

00:04:32.145 --> 00:04:36.164
into these, I think they're called
"power bumps" or something like that.

00:04:36.614 --> 00:04:40.304
Uh well here, you know, it's kinda,
it's like that little kid with

00:04:40.304 --> 00:04:42.465
his mittens tied to his sleeves.

00:04:42.614 --> 00:04:43.724
I'm not going to lose these.

00:04:43.724 --> 00:04:48.284
So I use these "power beats", maybe
they're called and more recently I

00:04:48.284 --> 00:04:53.025
discovered that there's these guys,
because sometimes I get tired of

00:04:53.025 --> 00:04:55.635
having something stuck in my ear.

00:04:55.635 --> 00:04:57.104
So these are called open ear.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:01.290
And uh, so I also use these and
it's a relief not to have something

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:02.460
stuck in your ear the whole time.

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:07.530
So I have invested a little money
in these listening devices because I

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:09.690
spend so much of my time listening.

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:11.880
Listening triggers it.

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:16.730
Listening triggers it because I listen
and I don't understand, so then I

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:19.490
have to go through it on LingQ, okay.

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:20.840
And read it.

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:24.590
And so that gets me going,
that's that first step that

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.659
well begun is the job have done.

00:05:27.555 --> 00:05:28.845
It's so easy for me.

00:05:28.845 --> 00:05:32.505
I get up in the morning, I just put
the audio on and I do my morning

00:05:32.505 --> 00:05:35.775
